# 📅 DAY 1 – SPRING BOOT PROJECT SETUP & ARCHITECTURE

**Objective:** Create and configure the complete Spring Boot Maven project.

### 1. Project Setup
- Create Spring Boot Maven project.
- Configure Java 21.
- Configure Spring Boot 3.5.4.
- Project Name: MedCore-HMS.
- Base Package: `com.medcore.hms`.
- Configure Maven dependencies.

### 2. Required Dependencies
1. Spring Web
2. Spring Data JPA
3. Spring Security
4. MySQL Driver
5. Validation
6. Spring Boot DevTools
7. Springdoc OpenAPI / Swagger
8. Spring Data Redis
9. JWT Dependencies
10. Spring Boot Actuator

### 3. Create Package Structure

```text
com.medcore.hms
│
├── MedCoreHmsApplication.java
│
├── config
├── security
├── common
│   ├── constants
│   ├── response
│   └── enums
│
├── exception
├── validation
├── util
│
└── modules
    ├── auth
    ├── user
    ├── role
    ├── hospital
    ├── department
    ├── doctor
    ├── patient
    ├── appointment
    ├── medicalrecord
    ├── prescription
    ├── billing
    ├── pharmacy
    └── notification
```

Each module will have separate packages for:
- controller
- service
- service.impl
- repository
- entity
- dto
- mapper

### 4. MySQL Database Setup

```sql
CREATE DATABASE medcore_hms_db;

USE medcore_hms_db;

SHOW DATABASES;
```

### 5. Configure application.properties

```properties
spring.application.name=MedCore-HMS

server.port=8080

spring.datasource.url=jdbc:mysql://localhost:3306/medcore_hms_db
spring.datasource.username=root
spring.datasource.password=YOUR_PASSWORD

spring.datasource.driver-class-name=com.mysql.cj.jdbc.Driver

spring.jpa.hibernate.ddl-auto=update
spring.jpa.show-sql=true
spring.jpa.properties.hibernate.format_sql=true
```

Replace `YOUR_PASSWORD` with your MySQL password.

### 6. Run Application
- Run MedCoreHmsApplication.java.
- Verify Spring Boot startup.
- Verify MySQL connection.
- Check port 8080.
- Resolve all errors.

